{"ordinal":11083,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454107766784","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Death_053df51","source":"FunnyGuy: Мой ад заканчивается.","target":"FunnyGuy: Iadul meu se sfârșește.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11084,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454103572491","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Death_0f03917","source":"FunnyGuy: Ну хоть для меня это закончится.","target":"FunnyGuy: Măcar pentru mine o să se termine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11085,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454103572490","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Death_0f03b3b","source":"FunnyGuy: Вот это у тебя смехуечки.","target":"FunnyGuy: Ce glume bune ai.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11086,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454103572489","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Ears_DontShoot_0e48715","source":"FunnyGuy: И с работы попёрли нас несправедливо.","target":"FunnyGuy: Și ne-au dat afară de la muncă pe nedrept.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11087,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454103572488","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Ears_DontShoot_063aac5","source":"FunnyGuy: Всё-таки несправедливо у меня отжали деньги.","target":"FunnyGuy: Tot pe nedrept mi-au luat banii.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11088,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454103572487","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Photo_DontShoot_0495903","source":"FunnyGuy: У меня теперь тоже такое отношение к фоткам.","target":"FunnyGuy: Acum și eu reacționez așa la fotografii.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11089,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454103572486","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Photo_DontShoot_065f41a","source":"FunnyGuy: «Ой, убери, чё ты припёрся с фотиком, иди лягушек пофоткай».","target":"FunnyGuy: „Of, ia-l de aici! Ce te-ai înființat cu aparatul? Du-te și fotografiază broaște.”","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11090,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454103572485","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Photo_DontShoot_0b4dff0","source":"FunnyGuy: В нашей семье все как-то реагировали на фото… по-злому, что ли.","target":"FunnyGuy: La noi în familie, toți reacționau la fotografii… cu răutate, parcă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11091,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454103572484","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Armpit_DontShoot_0ea2aa1","source":"FunnyGuy: Не жизнь, а сказка, АХАХАХА.","target":"FunnyGuy: Viață de poveste, HAHAHA.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11092,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454103572483","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Armpit_DontShoot_08b08aa","source":"FunnyGuy: Работы нет, деньги украли банки, ещё и солнце жарит каждый день.","target":"FunnyGuy: N-am serviciu, băncile mi-au furat banii și soarele dogorește zilnic.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11093,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454103572482","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Armpit_DontShoot_0f079ff","source":"FunnyGuy: Ну, видимо, сейчас на пенсию выхожу.","target":"FunnyGuy: Ei, se pare că ies la pensie acum.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11094,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454103572481","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Eyes_DontShoot_058da0b","source":"FunnyGuy: Ну и бог тебе судья.","target":"FunnyGuy: Ei, Dumnezeu să te judece.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11095,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454103572480","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Eyes_DontShoot_0428cc1","source":"FunnyGuy: Я тебя прекрасно вижу. Как и ружьё, которое ты недавно наставлял.","target":"FunnyGuy: Te văd foarte bine. Și pușca pe care ai îndreptat-o spre mine mai devreme.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11096,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454099378186","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Eyes_DontShoot_0ed12bc","source":"FunnyGuy: Что ты хочешь ещё услышать-то?","target":"FunnyGuy: Ce mai vrei să auzi?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11097,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454099378185","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Hands_DontShoot_09515fe","source":"FunnyGuy: Даже умереть спокойно не дадут.","target":"FunnyGuy: Nici să mor liniștit nu mă lasă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11098,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454099378184","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Hands_DontShoot_0d2dde8","source":"FunnyGuy: Предприятие закрывают из-за растущих убытков.","target":"FunnyGuy: Închid fabrica din cauza pierderilor tot mai mari.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11099,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454099378183","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Hands_DontShoot_0df0a38","source":"FunnyGuy: Отпахал как чёрт, а что толку.","target":"FunnyGuy: Am muncit ca dracu’, și ce folos?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11100,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454099378182","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Hands_DontShoot_08b88c6","source":"FunnyGuy: Вот мог ты себе представить, что в очередной рабочий день тебя просто сократят?","target":"FunnyGuy: Ți-ai fi putut imagina că, într-o zi obișnuită de muncă, te concediază pur și simplu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11101,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454099378181","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FunnyGuy_Teeth_DontShoot_02fa344","source":"FunnyGuy: История про зубы? Ну не, ты ж не думал, что можешь просто наставить оружие, а потом как ни в чём не бывало общаться!","target":"FunnyGuy: Povestea cu dinții? Ei, nu credeai că poți să îndrepți arma spre mine și apoi să stăm la taclale ca și cum nu s-ar fi întâmplat nimic!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-283.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
